Hello Team, I am following this PR since long by seeing the impact for few of the Kubernetes customers. Do we have any tentative timeline and plan of action for the release of this feature. Appreciate your help.

One of the primary challenges is that it can lead to additional cost and  delays in scaling applications that rely on pods. The grace period is the time between the initial signal to delete a pod and the actual deletion, during which the pod is terminated and its resources are cleaned up. If the grace period cannot be shortened, it may take longer for the pod to be completely removed, which could cause delays in restarting or scaling the application.

